

2025-12-06:

Today I spent about three hours working on the Smart Islami Box project. I started by createing a 3D STL case with blender. The case is 24.7 cm by 10.7 cm
by 10.2 cm so that all the components, including the Raspberry Pi,three servos, RTC module, speaker, and LED strip, would fit inside. After that, 
I made some small adjustments like makeing the tower to give the case a more real look. I exported it as STL to use it in the project and also took a 
screenshot of the STL to include in the README. While working, I realized that choosing the right size was very important tomake sure everything fits properly.
I’m happy with the design and feel like it’s a good start.
